# Defense in depth on top of package.json "files". Runtime secrets and
# machine-local config must never ship, even if they land under dist/, bin/,
# or examples/.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
secrets/
**/secrets/
.plaud-notes-to-notion/
**/.plaud-notes-to-notion/
config.json
**/config.json
*.log
*.pem
*.key
*.tgz
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
